---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Learn about our mission, editorial standards, and how we test developer tools." />
		<style is:global>
			body {
				background-color: #0b0f17 !important;
				color: #cbd5e1 !important;
			}
		</style>
		<style>
			main {
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 3em 1em;
			}
			.about-hero {
				text-align: center;
				padding: 3em 1.5em;
				background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0) 70%),
				            linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
				border-radius: 16px;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				margin-bottom: 2.5em;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
			}
			.about-hero h1 {
				font-size: 2.5em;
				margin-bottom: 0.3em;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #93c5fd 100%);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			}
			.about-hero p {
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 1.15em;
				max-width: 600px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}
			.values-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
				gap: 1.5em;
				margin: 2em 0 3em 0;
			}
			.value-card {
				background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.8);
				backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 1.5em;
			}
			.value-card h3 {
				color: #60a5fa;
				margin-top: 0;
				font-size: 1.2em;
			}
			.value-card p {
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 0.95em;
				line-height: 1.5;
				margin-bottom: 0;
			}
			.process-section {
				background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
				border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
				padding: 1.5em 2em;
				border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
				margin: 2em 0;
			}
			.process-section h2 {
				color: #f8fafc;
				margin-top: 0;
			}
			.process-section ol {
				color: #cbd5e1;
				padding-left: 1.2em;
				line-height: 1.8;
			}
			h2 {
				color: #f8fafc;
			}
			p {
				line-height: 1.7;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="about-hero">
				<h1>Engineered for Clarity</h1>
				<p>Helping developers, engineering leads, and technical founders choose the right AI and software stack without the marketing fluff.</p>
			</div>

			<h2>Why StackVerdict Exists</h2>
			<p>
				The modern developer ecosystem is saturated with high-velocity AI tools, IDE plugins, and DevOps platforms. 
				Most reviews online are either superficial promotional summaries or copy-pasted product documentation. 
				<strong>StackVerdict</strong> was founded to bridge the gap between marketing promises and real-world developer benchmarks.
			</p>

			<div class="values-grid">
				<div class="value-card">
					<h3>🎯 Real Workloads</h3>
					<p>We test tools inside real-world codebases, evaluating multi-file refactoring, latency, and context limitations.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="value-card">
					<h3>🛡️ Unbiased Testing</h3>
					<p>Sponsorships never alter our conclusions. If a tool fails under load or hallucinations spike, we report it directly.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="value-card">
					<h3>💡 Cost Efficiency</h3>
					<p>We break down pricing tiers, API usage costs, and seat limits to ensure your team gets maximum ROI.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="process-section">
				<h2>Our Review Methodology</h2>
				<ol>
					<li><strong>Setup & Deployment:</strong> We configure each tool in standard production-like environments.</li>
					<li><strong>Stress Testing:</strong> We push context windows and complex code completions to measure accuracy and drop-off.</li>
					<li><strong>Verdict & Comparison:</strong> We compare performance against direct market competitors to provide clear recommendations.</li>
				</ol>
			</div>

			<h2>Affiliate & Disclosure Policy</h2>
			<p>
				To keep our content free and support our testing infrastructure, we participate in affiliate programs. 
				When you sign up or purchase through links on StackVerdict, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. 
				However, our editorial choices remain completely independent.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>